  "source": [
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Global.Text 42053 'Robgoblin Geomancer!' (title), 73658 (card), objective 417401; icon 4541."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "Starter: reference Npcs.json Id 4110 drawn at [-1249.31, -63.93, 1179.56] (npc_spawns_extra.json spawn_guid 100000004110, FreeRealms-Legacy FabledRealms.lua). Region The Wilds, place The Wilds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 47 ('Robgoblin Geomancer! (the live random encounter: a robgoblin geomancer)'): scene sg_random_encounter_02, entry, exit, 3 waves, 9 spawns ({'Robgoblin Knuckle Head': 5, 'Robgoblin Wiz-ord': 3, 'Robgoblin Geomancer': 1})."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1242 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene sg_random_encounter_02 has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 30 coins / 140 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) rc-0136 (2026-11-11): model 191 robgoblin_m_mage.adr, a robgoblin caster for the boss; 1914 sg_spawner_robgoblin_01.adr is the starter's junk-pile prop, not a fighter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) rc-0136 (2026-11-11): this row is the battle's starter, the prop 2014 drew it as (the Snarler's den: video 5-IM2pBh2yY frames 01048 and 01080, red name, crossed swords, Press X; capture p12 t=546051.7 model 1938). The fight's own kind carries the body its waves fight with."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) rc-0137 prize wheel (2026-11-12): 'Robgoblin Geomancer!' has no wheel of its own on the wiki; the wiki's item pages put its prize wheel with 'Mugwort's Hollow' (Ninja's Jagged Scythe of Flame Wave; Wizard's Jewel Wand of Tsunami; Warrior’s Double Axe of Warcry; Medic's Megasaw of Immunization), so it spins that wheel, from fandom 'Mugwort's Hollow' (revision 49142), one per combat job, and 97 coins. Conflict: its own row says difficulty 2 (the fork's), while 'Mugwort's Hollow' is difficulty 4; the fight keeps its difficulty. The same pages also name Oasis of Peril!, mugwort_s_hollow, oasis_of_peril. Medic: the wiki's 'Pressure Wave Medic Pants' is 'Pressure Wave Medic Fatigues' in our record dungeons/mugwort_s_hollow.json; Warrior: the wiki's 'Threat Range Warrior Greaves' is 'Threat Range Warrior Breeches' in our record dungeons/mugwort_s_hollow.json."
    }
  ]
